    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 6,
   "tag": "p×2",
   "class": "container max-width-1300 wp-block-paragraph",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 248,
   "text": "Many collectors treat the stylus like a permanent fixture. It’s not. Replacing it at the right time helps preserve both your sound quality and your vinyl.\nBefore replacing it, it helps to understand what the stylus actually does and why it matters.",
