   "textLength": 370,
   "text": "If you don’t show your stylus the respect it deserves by paying attention to how many hours it’s clocking and retiring it when necessary, the effects will be more than just compromised playback. You could also damage your records by having a worn needle gouging micro-chips or bearing heavily against grooves. A misshapen stylus could even start carving into your vinyl.",
